OL,3,CBody found in search for kayaker, 19,
OL,4,Cwho went missing after capsize at sea
OL,6,FA body has been found in the search
OL,7,Ffor a teenager who went missing after
OL,8,Fa kayak capsized off the coast of
OL,9,FNorthumberland last month.
OL,11,FMichael Henry, 19, from the Rothbury
OL,12,Farea, was one of two men in the boat
OL,13,Fnear Boulmer when he disappeared on
OL,14,Fthe evening of 7 July, Northumbria
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe other man managed to make it to a
OL,18,Fbuoy and was rescued by the coastguard.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/4
