PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785853117
OL,3,CBody found in search for kayaker, 19,
OL,4,Cwho went missing after capsize at sea
OL,6,FOn Monday (3 August), Northumbria
OL,7,FPolice confirmed a body found in water
OL,8,Foff the coast of Blyth on 26 July was
OL,9,Fthe teenager's.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the force said:
OL,12,F"Following extensive searches, Michael
OL,13,Fwas located in the water off the coast
OL,14,Fof Blyth on July 26.
OL,16,F"Formal identification has since taken
OL,17,Fplace, and a report has been prepared
OL,18,Ffor the coroner."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
