PN,39303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785853117
OL,3,CBody found in search for kayaker, 19,
OL,4,Cwho went missing after capsize at sea
OL,6,FFollowing his disappearance, Mr
OL,7,FHenry's family described him as a
OL,8,F"much-loved son, brother, grandson,
OL,9,Fnephew, team-mate and friend" and a
OL,10,F"keen sportsman who loved the
OL,11,Foutdoors".
OL,13,FThey also offered their thanks to all
OL,14,Fthose who helped in the search for him.
OL,16,FPaying tribute, they said: "We would
OL,17,Flike to thank everyone for all their
OL,18,Flove, kindness and support now and
OL,19,Fthroughout Michael's life; it was that
OL,20,Flove and kindness that made him the
OL,21,Fmarvellous person he was.
OL,26,@xD@\OU
