CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785853117
OL,3,CBody found in search for kayaker, 19,
OL,4,Cwho went missing after capsize at sea
OL,6,F"Michael was preparing to go
OL,7,Ftravelling this summer and hoping to
OL,8,Fstart university next academic year.
OL,9,FMichael will be forever in our
OL,10,Fthoughts, and we will miss him.
OL,12,F"Our thanks go to the emergency
OL,13,Fservices and everyone who is helping
OL,14,Fto search for Michael."
